==Trivia ==
*The Skeleton Dragons resemble [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_dragon dragons from European cultures]. being reptilian legendary creatures, often depicted as winged, horned, and capable of breathing fire.
**In the Chinese and Persian language settings of the game, the Skeleton Dragons' name translates to "Skeleton Wyverns".
*The word "''Skeleton''" comes from the Greek "''σκελετός''" (''skeletós''), meaning dried up or withered.
**The Skeleton Dragons is 1 of 15 [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Guards]], [[Skeleton Army]], [[Witch]], [[Balloon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Super Witch]], [[Graveyard]], [[Skeleton King]], and of course, Skeletons.
**The Skeleton Dragons is 1 of 5 cards associated with Dragons, with the others being Baby Dragon, Inferno Dragon, Electro Dragon, and of course, Skeleton Dragons
***When defeated, Skeleton Dragons briefly crumble into a pile of bones, unlike most other Skeleton-cards which just vanish.
*The Skeleton Dragons were designed after [https://youtu.be/J-CGy8efpHA?si=cTr99k0lvQD6p-U7&t=65 a scrapped concept] of a singular Skeleton Dragon that would attack with a bomb, as well as the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Beta_Minion Beta Minions] from Clash of Clans.
* The Skeleton Dragons have been featured in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]] outside of the card. More specifically:
**The Skeleton Dragons are 1 of 23 troops that have been featured in the [[Troop Rush]] game [[:Category:Modes|mode]], the others being Skeletons, [[Fire Spirit]], [[Bats]], [[Elite Barbarians]], [[Firecracker]], [[Rascals|Rascal Girls]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Heal Spirit]], [[Elixir Golem]], Guards, [[Prince]], Balloon, [[Golem]], Wall Breakers, [[Ram Rider]], [[Sparky]], [[Phoenix]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Bandit]], [[Lumberjack]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], and the [[Monk]].
***Along with Guards, the Skeleton Dragons in the Troop Rush game mode would spawn in random positions instead of behind the [[Princess Towers|Crown Towers]].
**The Skeleton Dragons are 1 of 4 troops that has been featured in the [[Treasure Hunt#Dragon Hunt|Dragon Hunt]] sub-mode of the [[Treasure Hunt]] game mode, the others being [[Baby Dragon]], [[Electro Dragon]], and [[Inferno Dragon]].
**The Skeleton Dragons are 1 of 2 troops that has been featured with a [[Buff#Knockback Attack|Knockback Attack]] [[buff]], the other being Bomber.
*In the card's description, the "''They also play a mean rib cage xylophone duet''" line is likely a reference to a piece of music called [https://youtu.be/0TSkIG9lFvY Fossiles (Fossils)] of the album "''[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Carnival_of_the_Animals Carnival of the Animals]''" by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camille_Saint-Sa%C3%ABns Camille Saint-Saëns].
*The skull of the Skeleton Dragons resembles the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Obstacles?file=Obstacle_Halloween_2017.png Halloween Obstacle] from Clash of Clans.
*The Skeleton Dragons and Bats are the only troops which have been available outside their card before they were released as cards. In the case of the Skeleton Dragons, they were available as a spawned troop in the Dragon Hunt sub-mode of the Treasure Hunt game mode.
*The Skeleton Dragons, along with the [[Minions]], Bomber, Skeletons, [[Ice Spirit]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Dart Goblin]], Elixir Golem, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], Guards, Baby Dragon, [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], Giant Skeleton, Golem, Wall Breakers, [[Bowler]], [[Executioner]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Lava Hound]], and the Skeleton King, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*The Skeleton Dragons are the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*The Skeleton Dragons were featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/vRrgTfqRdpw?si=YDASUydL7qNm9QZz Clash Royale League 2023 Tournament], by a player called Mugi.
*Before the Skeleton Dragons' card release, the Skeleton Dragons' area radius was increased to 0.8 tiles (from 0.6 tiles).

